Name: uluru
Short Name: uluru
URL: https://github.com/servo/uluru
Version: 3.1.0
Revision: fc4a87761db7ee944b781e456cdbd5d6e41799b7
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py uluru, history replayed linearly)
License: MPL-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A simple, fast, LRU cache implementation

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/uluru/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/uluru/ unchanged.

Crates:
  uluru 3.1.0 third_party/uluru/uluru
